{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922042234_3ebec8d9","chunk_index":9,"job_id":"mwjob_cffd00bfa3697e3b95523084","precondition_digest":"f483172f30b055a8b1e1a0031ff9bcf82f903ed2e0e2f5846600e2e4c3920808","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v8","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_27e7b9590fd8c895","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_2ac8e3c15d7050ab","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d413096e15cdc754","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b3cae21f267891a1"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922042234_3ebec8d9","content_status":"decision_required","decision_items":[{"blocking_section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_27e7b9590fd8c895","fact_path":"picos.allowed_concomitant_rules","options":[{"label":"仅允许润肤剂和合并疾病稳定用药","option_id":"opt_allowed_emollients_and_stable_comedication","summary":"允许使用润肤剂以及针对合并疾病的稳定剂量用药；不允许任何抗银屑病局部治疗、系统治疗或光疗。所有合并用药均需记录并评估对疗效和安全性评价的影响。"},{"label":"允许稳定剂量的局部抗银屑病治疗","option_id":"opt_allowed_stable_topical_antipsoriatic","summary":"允许润肤剂、合并疾病稳定用药以及基线前已稳定使用的局部抗银屑病治疗，研究期间不得增加剂量或频次；禁止系统抗银屑病治疗和光疗。所有合并用药均需记录。"}],"question":"研究期间允许的合并用药/治疗范围应如何规定？","rationale":"允许来源未定义本项目允许合并用药规则；推荐严格选项以降低对PASI和sPGA疗效评价的干扰，最终由医学作者结合研究药物特征和安全性监测需求确认。","recommended_option_id":"opt_allowed_emollients_and_stable_comedication"}],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:37729c5fa2b04482d3ac49ea","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_27e7b9590fd8c895\n章节编号=6.6.1\n章节标题=允许的合并用药/治疗","quote_sha256":"1e1fc5f3c5bf9e2194076b14af27aea15224d3e0fe600dc268641a4dacf73cde","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:37729c5fa2b04482d3ac49ea","span_id":"span_661"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究题目：合成试验药A用于治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的III期临床研究","quote_sha256":"39f86855784611b541acfcdc9bde1954b606955366139902ea030dd2587d715e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_title"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"总体研究设计：平行组（parallel assignment）、双盲、安慰剂对照、随机","quote_sha256":"671a62a354113705569b311f82cdff13e6dc35ab5faac84b8993f18ac7fe7ebc","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_design"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"试验干预：试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，连续16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂。","quote_sha256":"f3eff5ef57b4691ff025db695140e4ead682562786c0dec621edcd256ef28af3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_intervention"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"排除标准模块：非斑块型银屑病为主要表现，或存在可能干扰疗效/安全性评价的其他活动性皮肤病；活动性严重感染；妊娠或哺乳期；研究者判断不适合参加。","quote_sha256":"25de1577631d408629fd83338122249e7d0333f30cafbcf4445c1c9991fc6aee","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_exclusion"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"估计目标策略：治疗策略人群为所有随机受试者；比较第16周PASI 75应答。停药或使用救援治疗按复合策略判定为无应答，其他缺失数据采用无应答填补；报告组间率差及95%置信区间。","quote_sha256":"44f71070d9cdb5b6b69ad6feeeb7fbfeef4aad105693eaa3500bedd537f18414","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_estimand"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_661","span_title","span_design","span_intervention","span_exclusion","span_estimand"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"heading":"允许的合并用药/治疗","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"允许来源确认本节为第6.6.1节“允许的合并用药/治疗”。已确认研究事实包括研究人群为成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者、试验药物为合成试验药A 100 mg口服每日一次连续16周、双盲安慰剂对照设计，以及排除活动性严重感染、妊娠或哺乳期和可能干扰疗效/安全性评价的其他活动性皮肤病。允许合并用药类别、稳定性要求、记录方式及与救援治疗的关系未在允许来源中定义，需医学作者确认后写入。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_27e7b9590fd8c895","section_number":"6.6.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:37729c5fa2b04482d3ac49ea","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922042234_3ebec8d9","content_status":"decision_required","decision_items":[{"blocking_section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_2ac8e3c15d7050ab","fact_path":"picos.prohibited_concomitant_rules","options":[{"label":"禁止所有抗银屑病治疗及光疗","option_id":"opt_prohibited_all_antipsoriatic_and_phototherapy","summary":"禁止任何局部抗银屑病治疗、系统抗银屑病治疗和光疗；禁止使用可能干扰研究评价或与研究药物存在相互作用风险的药物。合并疾病必要用药需记录并经研究者评估。"},{"label":"仅禁止系统抗银屑病治疗和光疗","option_id":"opt_prohibited_systemic_and_phototherapy_only","summary":"禁止系统抗银屑病治疗和光疗；允许稳定剂量的局部抗银屑病治疗。禁止使用可能干扰研究评价或存在相互作用风险的药物。"}],"question":"研究期间禁止的合并用药/治疗应如何规定？","rationale":"允许来源未定义本项目禁止合并用药清单；推荐与严格允许规则一致的全面禁止选项，以降低对主要和关键次要疗效评价的混杂影响。","recommended_option_id":"opt_prohibited_all_antipsoriatic_and_phototherapy"}],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:37729c5fa2b04482d3ac49ea","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_2ac8e3c15d7050ab\n章节编号=6.6.2\n章节标题=禁止的合并用药/治疗","quote_sha256":"9a2ab0c72e998e049387063208d306ba5f70ba46467dc6637ef6590f8b7ecd0d","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:37729c5fa2b04482d3ac49ea","span_id":"span_662"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"总体研究设计：平行组（parallel assignment）、双盲、安慰剂对照、随机","quote_sha256":"671a62a354113705569b311f82cdff13e6dc35ab5faac84b8993f18ac7fe7ebc","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_design"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"试验干预：试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，连续16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂。","quote_sha256":"f3eff5ef57b4691ff025db695140e4ead682562786c0dec621edcd256ef28af3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_intervention"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"主要终点：第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例。","quote_sha256":"0726a50bb0c8f1c5ec79b9e21b343bfd08fddc0a595315a5c8e3769df01ce9a7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_primary"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"关键次要终点：第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级的受试者比例。；第16周达到PASI 90应答的受试者比例。","quote_sha256":"9ebc192fbc05715cf7f717f7f5899cd368f8790a1c880b7a2bff3665ad9ac302","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_key_secondary"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_safety"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_662","span_design","span_intervention","span_primary","span_key_secondary","span_safety"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"heading":"禁止的合并用药/治疗","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"允许来源确认本节为第6.6.2节“禁止的合并用药/治疗”。已确认研究事实包括双盲、安慰剂对照、随机设计，试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服每日一次连续16周，主要疗效终点为第16周PASI 75应答，关键次要终点包括sPGA和PASI 90，安全性终点涵盖TEAE、严重不良事件、导致停药的不良事件以及实验室检查、生命体征和12导联心电图的临床意义变化。禁止合并用药类别、是否允许局部抗银屑病治疗及违反禁用的处理未在允许来源中定义，需医学作者确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_2ac8e3c15d7050ab","section_number":"6.6.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:37729c5fa2b04482d3ac49ea","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922042234_3ebec8d9","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:37729c5fa2b04482d3ac49ea","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d413096e15cdc754\n章节编号=7\n章节标题=研究程序和评估","quote_sha256":"8ff79ab546236bca8cba5583192e08cee1a66a60511a9f61b82717175f976a1b","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:37729c5fa2b04482d3ac49ea","span_id":"span_7"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_periods"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_visits"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"剂量与给药方案：合成试验药A：100 mg，每日一次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周。依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"e97da70f0c9a5d6f604a29b6c054d0ed03fc9fd60470293f55ab4afbebddcff0","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_dose"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"匹配安慰剂：每日一次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周双盲治疗期。依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"6e161fdc710a0a80dfd37e8087ba89849d7bfdb2aa6b1f8d9a2466c304e8fae9","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_placebo"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"其他次要终点：第16周PASI评分较基线的变化。；第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化。","quote_sha256":"1f739c14310a6a5f292991854360290460a4b501e71c36ec724647d8123a4023","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_other_secondary"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_safety"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_7","span_periods","span_visits","span_dose","span_placebo","span_other_secondary","span_safety"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":6},"heading":"研究程序和评估","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究包括筛选期、双盲治疗期和安全性随访期。筛选期最长4周；双盲治疗期16周；安全性随访期4周。受试者于基线/第1天开始接受双盲治疗，试验组给予合成试验药A 100 mg口服每日一次，对照组给予匹配安慰剂，治疗持续至第16周。治疗期访视安排在第2、4、8、12、16周，第20周进行安全性随访。疗效评估包括PASI和sPGA，二者于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价；DLQI评分较基线的变化列为第16周其他次要终点。安全性评估包括治疗期间出现的不良事件、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率，以及实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记评价。","rationale":"已确认研究时期为筛选期最长4周、双盲治疗期16周、安全性随访期4周；访视策略为基线/第1天随机，第2、4、8、12、16周治疗期访视，第20周安全性随访，PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。给药方案、DLQI其他次要终点、安全性终点和依从性评价方式均有确认事实支持。医学作者需核对实验室检查、生命体征、12导联心电图和DLQI的具体采集时点，以及TEAE采集窗口和研究结束时点，这些细节未在允许来源中定义。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d413096e15cdc754","section_number":"7","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:37729c5fa2b04482d3ac49ea","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922042234_3ebec8d9","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:37729c5fa2b04482d3ac49ea","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_gr